            ("Are the Venom movies part of the MCU?", "No. Sony's Venom trilogy, Morbius, Madame Web and Kraven the Hunter are set in a separate Sony universe. Only the Tom Holland Spider-Man films are MCU, made by Marvel Studios with Sony. No Way Home and a Venom post-credits scene brush against each other, and that is the whole connection."),
